            {
                "comment": "Probably my favorite professor on the UW campus.  He likes to ask questions during lecture which works to keep class entertaining.  Answering his questions only gets you brownie points, but it may help boost you up a level for the final grade.  He is hilarious and always available for whatever you need.  I can't wait to take his other classes!",
